      "jcr:created": "Wed Jul 22 2020 18:44:17 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><br>\n Our Vision</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">We are committed to partnering with you to deliver meaningful education that improves outcomes and makes healthcare better. <br>\n Together, we're working to deliver best-in-class educational courses to advance surgical techniques and utilization of surgical devices for healthcare professionals. </span><br>\n&nbsp;</p>\n",
