              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "line1": "<span class=\"fontsize-4vw\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">We've gone</span> <span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,255,255);\">virtual</span></span></span></span><span class=\"fontsize-3vw\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\"><br />\r\n </span></span></span>",
              "line2": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,255,255);\">We're taking our MedEd programs virtual. <br>\r\n Whether you are in the office, the OR, or at home, our MedEd team is by your side.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>We’ve expanded our MedEd programs in an effort to help you help your patients, adding a range of online training options. <br>\r\nWe are committed to providing our best in class MedEd programs and resources!</p>\r\n",
