    "section_title_966375883": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "user-7065227e84@example.invalid",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7065227e84@example.invalid",
      "jcr:created": "Wed Jul 22 2020 18:52:58 GMT+0000",
      "title": "Grants and donations",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jul 22 2020 18:53:12 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/section-title"
    },
    "text_copy": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "user-7065227e84@example.invalid",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7065227e84@example.invalid",
      "jcr:created": "Wed Jul 22 2020 18:03:25 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p>Stryker recognizes the critical role of medical education in advancing medical technologies, treatments, knowledge and patient care. With review and approval from Stryker’s Grants and Donations Committee, we’re honored to support worthy educational events with educational grants and charitable contributions.<br>\n<br>\n</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jul 22 2020 18:28:14 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
    "cols2_2_3_1_3_copy_1944882166": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "user-7065227e84@example.invalid",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7065227e84@example.invalid",
      "jcr:created": "Wed Jul 22 2020 18:26:38 GMT+0000",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jul 22 2020 18:26:38 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/columncontrol/cols2_2-3_1-3",
      "col1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-7065227e84@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7065227e84@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Wed Jul 22 2020 18:03:25 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p style=\"margin-left: 40px;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><br>\n <span style=\"color: #000000;\">Learn more and request support</span></span></span></span></span><br>\nTo learn more about our guidelines and apply for an educational grant or charitable contribution, please visit<span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"> <a href=\"https://globalrequests.stryker.com/\">https://globalrequests.stryker.com/</a></span></span> </span>to apply.<br>\n<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jul 22 2020 19:34:19 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(237,238,236,1)",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text_copy_583752930": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-7065227e84@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7065227e84@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Wed Jul 22 2020 18:03:25 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>To help create the maximum benefit for participants and the larger healthcare community, we’ve developed principles that guide our decisions about which programs to support:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>We may make educational grants to bona fide educational activities for healthcare professionals and may include funding for accredited continuing education.<br>\n<br>\n</li>\n<li>We make educational grants to institutions—not to individual healthcare professionals.<br>\n<br>\n</li>\n<li>We don’t use grants to induce customers to purchase or use our products or services, to promote off-label uses of our products or as a substitute for discounts.<br>\n<br>\n</li>\n<li>We make grants to educational programs that are scientifically justified—our support is never intended to be promotional.<br>\n<br>\n</li>\n<li>We make continuing medical education grants only to programs that follow standards for development and delivery established by the FDA, the Accreditation Council for Continuing Medical Education, AdvaMed and other applicable bodies.<br>\n<br>\n</li>\n<li>Stryker is dedicated to supporting medical mission trips. We have partnered with Project C.U.R.E in providing high-quality products for medical missions to developing countries. If you are a medical professional going on a humanitarian trip and are in need of Stryker supplies, please visit <a href=\"https://projectcure.org/\">https://projectcure.org/</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jul 22 2020 19:36:30 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
